{"ticker":"HSY","updated":"2026-11-13T23:34:28Z","profile":{"longName":"The Hershey Company","shortName":"The Hershey Company","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Confectioners","country":"United States","website":"https://www.thehersheycompany.com","fullTimeEmployees":17550,"marketCap":35024850944,"trailingPE":19.7138,"forwardPE":18.403917,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.8573046,"pegRatio":0.88,"targetMeanPrice":180.90475,"targetHighPrice":230.0,"targetLowPrice":154.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.03,"earningsGrowth":1.118,"grossMargins":0.41949,"operatingMargins":0.21195999,"profitMargins":0.14632,"totalRevenue":12258003968,"beta":0.068,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":239.48,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":156.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.35},"summary":"The Hershey Company, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of confectionery products and pantry items in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: North America Confectionery, North America Salty Snacks, and International. The company offers chocolate and non-chocolate confectionery products; gum and mint refreshment products, including mints, chewing gums, and bubble gums; protein bars; pantry items, such as baking ingredients, toppings, beverages, and sundae syrups; and snack items comprising spreads, bars, snack bites, mixes, popcorn, and pretzels. It provides its products primarily under the Hershey's, Reese's, Kisses, Jolly Rancher, Almond Joy, Brookside, barkTHINS, Cadbury, Good & Plenty, Heath, Kit Kat, Payday, Rolo, Twizzlers, Sour Strips, Whoppers, York, Ice Breakers, Breath Savers, Bubble Yum, Lily's, SkinnyPop, Pirates Booty, Dot's Homestyle Pretzels, and ONE Bar brands, as well as under the Pelon Pelo Rico, IO-IO, and Sofit brands. The company markets and sells its products to wholesale distributors, chain grocery stores, mass merchandisers, chain drug stores, vending companies, wholesale clubs, convenience stores, dollar stores, concessionaires, and department stores. It exports its products in approximately 65 countries worldwide. The Hershey Company was founded in 1894 and is based in Hershey, Pennsyl","summary_zh":"好時公司及其子公司在美國和國際上從事糖果產品和食品儲藏室的製造和銷售。它透過三個部門運作：北美糖果部門、北美鹹味零食部門和國際部門。該公司提供巧克力和非巧克力糖果產品；口香糖和薄荷茶點產品，包括薄荷糖、口香糖和泡泡糖；蛋白質棒；食品儲藏室物品，例如烘焙原料、配料、飲料和聖代糖漿；零食包括塗抹醬、能量棒、小吃、混合食品、爆米花和椒鹽捲餅。其產品主要以 Hershey's、Reese's、Kisses、Jolly Rancher、Almond Joy、Brookside、barkTHINS、Cadbury、Good & Plenty、Heath、Kit Kat、Payday、Rolo、Twizzlers、Sour Strips、Whoppers、York、Icece、Rolo、Twizzlers、Sour Strips、Whoppers、York、Icece、Alcek、Zbble、Skirs、Sersk、Helk、Girk、Girk、Zbble、Sman、St. Homestyle Pretzels、和 ONE Bar 品牌，以及 Pelon Pelo Rico、IO-IO 和 Sofit 品牌。該公司向批發分銷商、連鎖雜貨店、量販店、連鎖藥店、自動販賣公司、批發俱樂部、便利商店、一元商店、特許經營店和百貨公司行銷和銷售其產品。其產品出口到全球約 65 個國家。好時公司成立於 1894 年，總部位於賓州好時","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"糖果商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":186.31,"h":186.93,"l":184.26,"c":185.56,"v":939500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":192.48,"h":195.35,"l":188.71,"c":193.45,"v":2815300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":193.09,"h":194.91,"l":189.95,"c":191.09,"v":1189300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":189.12,"h":190.5,"l":187.58,"c":189.08,"v":1869300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":189.22,"h":190.69,"l":187.86,"c":190.18,"v":3209100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":190.12,"h":193.46,"l":188.32,"c":192.34,"v":1718400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":191.93,"h":192.92,"l":189.82,"c":190.74,"v":1308800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":190.8,"h":192.08,"l":190.1,"c":190.89,"v":1136400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":192.34,"h":192.34,"l":185.11,"c":185.26,"v":1356600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":185.12,"h":188.42,"l":185.0,"c":188.11,"v":1043300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":187.67,"h":188.6,"l":183.27,"c":184.11,"v":1334700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":184.76,"h":187.66,"l":183.19,"c":187.05,"v":1074900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":187.09,"h":189.39,"l":184.45,"c":188.83,"v":1273900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":186.99,"h":189.88,"l":186.79,"c":189.02,"v":1056700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":189.0,"h":195.34